    "KFaceDistance[facetsLst_List, face 1 _List, face 2 _List] Given a \
simplicial complex as a list of facets facetsLst and two equal cardinality \
faces of facetsLst, face1 and face2 of cardinality k, it computes the minimum \
k-face distance between them where the path steps on only (k+1)-dimensional \
faces joined along k-dimensional subfaces. It uses the built in Mathematica \
GraphDistance function on a graph constructed such that the vertices are all \
k-faces and edges between them are 1 if two faces are contained in a bigger \
